# wlink directives for GDI.EXE (gdi/; ARCHITECTURE.md 11). Object files,
# the output name and the export table (build/gdi/exports.lnk, made by
# tools/mkgdiexp.py) come from the Makefile. Ordinals and names are the
# real module's (docs/exports/GDI.txt).
format windows dll
option modname=GDI
option description 'w16 Graphics Device Interface'
option start=gdi_libentry
option quiet
option map
option heapsize=10000
segment type code fixed preload
segment type data moveable preload
library windows.lib
